      "updated_at": "2019-10-12T21:05:55Z",
      "body": "I am quite certain that even without the *Remember me* feature, Laravel uses cookies, or some kind of local storage. There are Laravel packages which display a message about the use of cookies, for example [here](https://github.com/spatie/laravel-cookie-consent). This practice is only required by EU law, which, I think, explains why nothing shows up by default.",
